# Receivables

Read `docs/APP.md` before changing dues, payments, roles, or PDFs.

## Roles

- Accountant writes. Engineer is view-only.
- Hide add/edit/delete in the UI when `canEdit` is false.
- Also block on the server. UI hiding is not enough.

```ts
// ❌ BAD — engineer can POST this
export async function addDue(formData: FormData) { /* write */ }

// ✅ GOOD
const denied = await requireAccountant();
if (denied) return denied;

// Write routes (new / edit / due / pay / settings):
await redirectUnlessAccountant(receivables.client(id));
```

Do not move the accountant password into env, docs, or chat.

## Money and paths

- Store amounts as integer poisha via `src/lib/money.ts`. Show **Tk**, never `$` or `BDT`.
- Import paths from `@/lib/routes`. Do not hard-code `/receivables/...`.

```ts
// ❌ href="/receivables/clients/new"
// ✅ href={receivables.clientsNew}
```

## UI

Mobile-first: thumb-zone bottom nav, large tap targets, hero money cards. `AppShell` is receivables-only. Hub and other products use `SiteChrome`.
